# DIRA LEARN – build-time settings for Cloudflare Pages (Settings > Variables and Secrets, for Production and for Preview).
# Values come from Supabase > Project Settings > API. They are built into the public website, so only PUBLIC values belong here.
VITE_SUPABASE_URL=https://<project-ref>.supabase.co
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=<publishable (or anon) key>
# Optional: public DIRA Foundation website (privacy/terms links and cover photos). Default: https://dirafoundationken.netlify.app
# VITE_PUBLIC_SITE_URL=https://<dira-foundation-website>

# NEVER put here, in Cloudflare or in any committed file: the service-role / secret key, the database password, SMTP or
# Resend keys, CRON_SECRET, scanner tokens, Cloudflare API tokens. Server-side secrets are set only with
# `npx supabase secrets set ...` (docs/deployment/SUPABASE_PRODUCTION.md §3).
